{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/B1IW__07tDfbBaFFJIEL4w","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:21.559243+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/B1IW__07tDfbBaFFJIEL4w","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YZ6PibTiaxiaDTicJibWLOMqYmPbfRLhhOMGCpD0OzXQnVqxCxE7nKzAibkqCXbibk7bW7NCKkGWbY582qSYqkUyCW50R8zZ1vSfJOPbSbkiadVrfnQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span><span>江西财经大学科技商学院接收2027年推荐免试研究生招生预报名工作正式启动！我们热忱欢迎全国各地获得推免资格、立志于投身科技金融与科技成果转化事业的优秀学子，加入科技商学院，一起定义未来！</span></span></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/YZ6PibTiaxiaDT2wd7yFKmfnC3SwzNQlE6894ia1t9wuicTlsJwN83yfjcOVfGIOtr3YKofumKNOsE2Yywn1onaiaLoFlXhUiaI4UyP7167s29vzks/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介 </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>About BST</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><span><font><span><span>江西财经大学</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>科技商学院于</span></span></font><span><span>2025</span></span><font><span><span>年</span></span></font><font><span><span>8</span></span></font><font><span><span>月启动筹建，</span></span></font><font><span><span>2026</span></span></font><font><span><span>年</span></span></font><font><span><span>3</span></span></font><font><span><span>月经学校发文正式成立。</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>学院是学校为响应国家创新驱动发展战略，整合全校经济、管理、数据科学等多学科优势资源而组建的新型实体教研机构。学院聚焦科技成果转化价值链的</span></span></font><font><span><span>“中后端”，致力于成为持续向社会产业创新生态中不可或缺的“商业与金融大脑”，在产业变革时代，持续向社会输送高质量的“技术价值评估者、科技金融引领者”。</span></span></font></span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>我们秉持</span></span></font><font><span><span>“科技为体、商学为用、实战为要、价值为本”</span><span>的发展理念，打造</span><span>“金融赋能</span></span></font><font><span><span>+</span></span></font><font><span><span>商业洞察</span></span></font><font><span><span>+</span></span></font><font><span><span>产业深耕”</span><span>的核心特色，旨在培养</span><span>“懂科技、懂产业、懂资本、懂市场、懂管理”</span><span>的“五懂”复合领军人才。</span></span></font></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/YZ6PibTiaxiaDTLEv72AZFVtkE1MNfziaEHMPUGAESFEBRvmLdicPUMzNDhBUEWic847C1QaC09BxrguKo954afAMVL58yZqzNerHqG9Xj68zOn28/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业名称：金融硕士（科技方向） </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>Msc Finance (in Tech)</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><font><span>区别于传统金融硕士，本项目的核心特色在于：</span></font></span></p><ul><li><p><span><font><span><span>“三真”培养模式</span></span></font><font><span><span><span>：</span></span><span>真刀实枪砺人才（真实项目牵引）、真金白银兴产业（科创种子基金实战）、真招实策促转化（智库与政策研究）。</span></span></font></span></p></li><li><p><span><b><font><span><span>“五懂”复合定位</span></span></font></b><font><span><span><span>：</span></span><span>将金融、管理、产业、市场与科技深度融合，专注于技术价值评估、知识产权金融化、科创企业投融资等核心能力。</span></span></font></span></p></li><li><p><span><b><font><span><span>“双导师”制护航</span></span></font></b><span><font><span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>由</span></span></span></font><font><span>“校内学术导师</span></font><font><span>+</span></font><font><span>产业实践导师”共同指导，确保培养的实战性。</span></font></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><font><span><span>王牌课程体系</span></span></font><font><span><span>：</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span><span>开设《科技成果转化实务》《知识产权管理与运营》《科创企业估值与技术定价》《科技金融与风险投资》等特色课程，并融入《</span></span></span></font><font><span>AIGC</span></font><font><span>金融建模》《</span></font><font><span>AI</span></font><font><span>多智能体开发与实践》等</span></font><font><span>AI</span></font><font><span><span><span>赋能课程。</span></span></span></font></span></span></p></li></ul><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/YZ6PibTiaxiaDRncnsZqHOTw9soLpmP1azsuEpiadUXrF7IsnucInEvezhWAMhGx3LmuicT72uE70Ef9C39uMfgj1hiczK2Lglo9qk7CPbRaqDzH8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>培养模式自主选择和奖学金  </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>Tracks &amp; Scholarships</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><font><span>推免录取到我院全日制硕士研究生后，<span>在第三学期（即硕士二年级上学期）可以选择申请</span></span></font><font><span><span>“硕博连读制”培养模式</span>，通过考核后可取得博士研究生资格，在第三年进入博士阶段学习。硕博连读正常学制为</span></font><font><span>5</span></font><font><span>年，并在博士阶段享受博士生相关待遇。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span>全日制硕士研究生奖助体系包括学业奖学金、国家助学金、国家奖学金、江西省政府奖学金、优秀奖学金、单项奖学金、</span></font><font><span>“三助”岗位津贴等多项奖助学金。</span></font></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YZ6PibTiaxiaDRyu8mwdAxwHO9IrZFLnIGKAVfZRhYAg7dLXIksesUBYWrm11JCxs8zqmXEpN7EibZYOEy5uBbICNvicw2ylB9QclCiaaq6cFoJib8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免预报名安排 </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>Pre- registration</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><p><b><span><font><span><span>1. </span></span></font><font><span><span>预报名对象</span></span></font></span></b></p><ul><li><p><span><font><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正</span></font><span><font><span>。</span></font></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><font><span>具有或预计获得推荐免试资格的</span></font><span>2027</span><font><span>届普通全日制本科毕业生（含本校及外校），并取得所在学校硕士研究生推荐免试资格</span></font><font><span>。</span></font></span></p></li><li><p><span><font><span>勤奋学习，刻苦钻研，成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向</span></font><font><span>。</span></font></span></p></li><li><p><span><font><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录</span></font><font><span>。</span></font></span></p></li><li><p><span><font><span>身心健康，符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></font></span></p></li></ul><p><span><font><span>申请人员具有突出的研究能力与潜质，原则上具有良好的英语应用能力。欢迎经济学类、管理学类、数学类、计算机类、统计学类以及理工类等相关专业的考生申请，特别鼓励具有理工科和交叉学科背景的同学申请。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>2. </span></span></font><font><span><span>预报名时间</span></span></font></span></b></p><p><span><font><span>即日起至</span></font><font><span><span>2026</span></span></font><font><span><span>年</span></span></font><font><span><span>9</span></span></font><font><span><span>月</span></span></font><font><span><span>11</span></span></font><font><span><span>日下午</span></span></font><font><span><span>17:00</span></span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>3. </span></span></font><font><span><span>预报名申请材料</span></span></font></span></b></p><p><span><span><span><span>（1）</span><span><font><span>江西财经大学接收</span></font><font><span>2027</span></font><font><span>年推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）预报名申请表</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>份（下载见文末附件）。</span></font></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）</span><font><span>本科阶段成绩单</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>份（需加盖学校教务部门公章）。</span></font></span></p><p><span><span>（3）</span><font><span>英语水平证明材料</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>份（如</span></font><font><span>CET-4</span></font><font><span>、</span></font><font><span>CET-6</span></font><font><span>、</span></font><font><span>IELTS</span></font><font><span>、</span></font><font><span>TOEFL</span></font><font><span>等证书扫描件）。</span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>（4）</span></span><font><span>其他材料：可以提交获奖证书，体现自身学术水平、竞赛能力、行业研究能力、金融投融资方案的代表性成果、出版物、证书、原创性工作成果等材料复印件。</span></font></span></p><p><b><span><font><span><span>4. </span></span></font><font><span><span>申请方式及流程</span></span></font></span></b></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（1）</span></span></span></span><span><b><font><span><span>网上报名</span></span></font></b><font><span><span>：</span>请将上述</span></font><font><span>“</span></font><b><font><span>预报名申请材料</span></font></b><font><span>”的电子版制成</span></font><font><span>PDF</span></font><font><span>格式，与申请表（</span></font><font><span>Word</span></font><font><span>版）一并压缩成一个</span></font><font><span>zip</span></font><font><span>格式文件，文件命名为“姓名</span></font><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>本科学校</span></font><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>金融硕士（科技方向）</span></font><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>手机号码”，于</span></font><font><span><span>2026</span></span></font><font><span><span>年</span></span></font><font><span><span>9</span></span></font><font><span><span>月</span></span></font><font><span><span>11</span></span></font><font><span><span>日下午</span></span></font><font><span><span>17</span></span></font><font><span><span>：</span></span></font><font><span><span>00</span></span></font><font><span><span>前</span>发送至指定邮箱：</span></font><font><span><span>edu.bst@jxufe.edu.cn</span></span></font><font><span>。邮件主题请务必统一命名为：</span></font><font><span>2027</span></font><font><span>推免预报名</span></font><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>姓名</span></font><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>本科专业</span></font><font><span>-</span></font><font><span>手机号码。</span></font></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（2）</span></span><b><font><span><span>学院初审</span></span></font></b><font><span><span>：</span>学院对申请人提交的材料进行审核，确定进入复试的名单，并通过电话或者邮箱通知申请人。</span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>（3）</span></span><b><font><span><span>复试考核</span></span></font></b><font><span><span>：</span>学院</span></font></span><span><span><font><span>组织复试，复试采取综合面试方式进行（具体形式根据学校后续统一要求确定），</span></font><font><span>并确定预录取名单。未参加复试或复试不合格者不得录取</span></font></span><font><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></font></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YZ6PibTiaxiaDRZdXcJnyibibU92HCkkEJibmlt6eoqo5goKgQjFNWEaY2hhHiaLtuTMDjlEJWcicRz8d5jfTwZoaZicqPNazazO5KOwIxA13QjjjUoc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他注意事项 </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>Additional Notes</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><span>（1）</span><span><font><span>申请人必须保证提交的全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。对不符合规定或弄虚作假者，一经核实，我校将取消其报名、复试、录取资格或学籍。</span></font></span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）</span><font><span>已被我校录取的推免生，按照教育部要求，不得再次报名参加全国硕士研究生招生考试，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>（3）</span></span><font><span>请申请者务必提供自身准确有效的联系方式、联系邮箱，以免错失机会。</span></font></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/YZ6PibTiaxiaDSW7PXc2XCylPXfgGm06sPxeUnb2z5ElnPz23wastSm2O9dxTc8haI8B3D2mzjP4gSpBEq30TSnTZTfQQdz6uHoLHqICDVBPyQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系我们 </span></strong></p></section></section></sec